Asynchronous & concurrent & distributed networking framework for PHP.

* event-driven
* full asynchronous non-blocking
* multi-thread reactor
* multi-process worker
* millisecond timer
* async MySQL
* async task
* async read/write file system
* async dns lookup
* support IPv4/IPv6/UnixSocket/TCP/UDP

With OpenSSL (swoole 6.2 has no build without it) and php83-mysqlnd;
php83-swoole-openssl is the same for php83-mysqlnd-openssl.

PECL swoole for php83 of azsupport/ports, built from ext/swoole of the
release tarball of azsupport/php-src, which bundles it:
lib/php/20230831/swoole.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php83/conf.d.
